The glacial river is powerful; besides dropping the temperature on the continent and at sea, it is turning the monsters it touches into creatures of the new Snow Tribe.
We must stop the river's course, both on land and at the bottom of the sea.

Zarad came to help us. Combining the sacred power of Idhas with the Legendary Trident, we created this Sphere of Fire.
It will hold the temperature and stop the river's course.

Please, go to Snowstorm Valley in Gallubia Valley, summon the Sphere of Fire and defeat 150 monsters.
A light will mark the place to summon the Sphere of Fire.

Come back here when you are done.
